      <activity id="5abcd90f-1738-587f-b2c3-e25d2aca825c" activityNameId="01ea2d1f-de09-5d39-b0e5-1544cbdee00a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Greenhouse, glass walls and roof, metal tubes</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Greenhouse, glass walls and roof, metal tubes
The inventory refers to the production of a greenhouse with glass walls with a lifespan of 20 years
This inventory includes the production of the greenhouse as well as the permanent technical infrastructure, that is greenhouse (bearing structure and covering materials), heating and cooling systems, fertirrigation, CO2 injection, stocking facilities and working equipement as far as it is installed permanentely (i.e. chariots on rails etc.) working equipement as far as it is installed permanentely (i.e. chariots on rails etc).
Location: The inventory is modelled for Switzerland
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: Literature and manufacturer information.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_66d8967f-879f-3094-889c-f69a3e520fc0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
